# Inventory only: obtain real values externally; no executable fallback credentials.
# POSTGRES_USER
# POSTGRES_DB
# POSTGRES_PASSWORD
# STAGING_TLS_CERT (absolute path to externally issued PEM certificate chain)
# STAGING_TLS_KEY (absolute path to protected PEM private key)
# STAGING_TLS_NAME (DNS name covered by the certificate, used by verification)
# ENVIRONMENT must be staging for every A1 command.
# Contractual A1 provisioning (not consumed by the infrastructure profile):
# DATABASE_URL
# META_APP_SECRET
# META_VERIFY_TOKEN
# META_ACCESS_TOKEN
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY
# META_PHONE_NUMBER_ID
# META_GRAPH_API_VERSION
# CATALOG_HOST_DIR
# EVIDENCE_HOST_DIR
# API_IMAGE (real immutable ID from the approved manifest)
# FRONTEND_IMAGE (real immutable ID from the approved manifest)
# Operator station only: CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN; never copy it into this checkout.
# See docs/staging.md for external target fields, GPG and reviewed hooks.
